{"page":421,"verses":[{"verse_key":"33:23","surah":33,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"مِّنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ رِجَالٌ صَدَقُوا۟ مَا عَـٰهَدُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ عَلَيْهِ ۖ فَمِنْهُم مَّن قَضَىٰ نَحْبَهُۥ وَمِنْهُم مَّن يَنتَظِرُ ۖ وَمَا بَدَّلُوا۟ تَبْدِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There are men among the believers who honoured their pledge to God: some of them have fulfilled it by death, and some are still waiting. They have not changed in the least.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"Among","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رِجَالٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) men","transliteration":"rijālun","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"صَدَقُوا۟","en_gloss":"(who) have been true","transliteration":"ṣadaqū","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"(to) what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَـٰهَدُوا۟","en_gloss":"they promised Allah","transliteration":"ʿāhadū","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"they promised Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"[on it]","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَمِنْهُم","en_gloss":"And among them","transliteration":"famin'hum","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(is he) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَضَىٰ","en_gloss":"has fulfilled","transliteration":"qaḍā","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَحْبَهُۥ","en_gloss":"his vow","transliteration":"naḥbahu","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمِنْهُم","en_gloss":"and among them","transliteration":"wamin'hum","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(is he) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَنتَظِرُ ۖ","en_gloss":"awaits","transliteration":"yantaẓiru","verse_key":"33:23"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliterati